官軍欲殺融父暢，興世以袍覆暢而坐之，以此得免。興世卒，融著高履負土成墳。至是融啓竟陵王子良，乞代欣時死。子良答曰：「此乃是長史美事，恐朝有常典，不得如長史所懷。」遷黃門郎，太子中庶子，司徒左長史。融有孝義，忌月三旬不聽樂，事嫂甚謹。宋丞相義宣起事，父暢以不同將見殺，司馬竺超民諫免之。暢臨終謂諸子曰：「昔丞相事難，吾緣竺司馬得活，爾等必報其子弟。」後超民孫微冬月遭母喪，居貧，融往弔之，悉脫衣以爲賻，披牛被而反。常以兄事微。豫章王嶷、竟陵王子良薨，自以身經佐吏，哭輙盡慟。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete:p025:m0209","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete:p025:m0166"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"連記事張融赴竺微母喪。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete:p025:m0166","start":166,"end":169,"surface":"竺超民","kind":"person","person_id":"ek8_2h2_f8l","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete:p025","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete:p025:m0190","start":190,"end":193,"surface":"竺司馬","kind":"person","person_id":"ek8_2h2_f8l","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete:p025","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete:p025:m0206","start":206,"end":208,"surface":"超民","kind":"person","person_id":"ek8_2h2_f8l","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete:p025","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete"},{"id":"c-songshu-046-zhangchang-complete:p006:m0144","start":144,"end":147,"surface":"竺超民","kind":"person","person_id":"ek8_2h2_f8l","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-046-zhangchang-complete:p006","chapter_id":"c-songshu-046-zhangchang-complete"},{"id":"c-songshu-059-zhangchang:p015:m0070","start":70,"end":73,"surface":"竺超民","kind":"person","person_id":"ek8_2h2_f8l","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整張暢本傳及對話語境判讀；同字不跨篇自動合人，未圖校。","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-059-zhangchang:p015","chapter_id":"c-songshu-059-zhangchang"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-qi041-zhuwei-grandfather","subject_person_id":"5vs_w8w_7t3","object_person_id":"ek8_2h2_f8l","predicate":"grandfather","qualifiers":{"source_term":"超民孫微","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-041","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete-ws2044621","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete:p025","quote":"　　竟陵張欣時爲諸暨令，坐罪當死。欣時父興世宋世討南譙王義宣，官軍欲殺融父暢，興世以袍覆暢而坐之，以此得免。興世卒，融著高履負土成墳。至是融啓竟陵王子良，乞代欣時死。子良答曰：「此乃是長史美事，恐朝有常典，不得如長史所懷。」遷黃門郎，太子中庶子，司徒左長史。融有孝義，忌月三旬不聽樂，事嫂甚謹。宋丞相義宣起事，父暢以不同將見殺，司馬竺超民諫免之。暢臨終謂諸子曰：「昔丞相事難，吾緣竺司馬得活，爾等必報其子弟。」後超民孫微冬月遭母喪，居貧，融往弔之，悉脫衣以爲賻，披牛被而反。常以兄事微。豫章王嶷、竟陵王子良薨，自以身經佐吏，哭輙盡慟。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete:p025:m0209","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete:p025:m0166"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"連記事張融赴竺微母喪。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-songshu-046-zhangchang-complete-6-140","title":"丞相司馬","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","person_id":"ek8_2h2_f8l","attestations":[{"id":"th-songshu-046-zhangchang-complete-6-140:a","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-046-zhangchang-complete:p006","start":140,"end":144,"surface":"丞相司馬","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-046-zhangchang-complete:p006:m0144","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-046","chapter_id":"c-songshu-046-zhangchang-complete","source_id":"s-songshu-046-zhangchang-complete-ws2118581","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-046-zhangchang-complete:p006","quote":"及義宣有異圖，蔡超等以暢人望，勸義宣留之，乃解南蠻校尉以授暢，加冠軍將軍，領丞相長史。暢遣門生荀僧寶下都，因顏竣陳義宣釁狀。僧寶有私貨，止巴陵不時下。會義宣起兵，津路斷絕，遂不得前。義宣將為逆，使嬖人翟靈寶告暢，暢陳必無此理，請以死保之。靈寶還白義宣，云暢必不可回，請殺以徇眾，賴丞相司馬竺超民得免。進號撫軍，別立軍部，以收人望。暢雖署文檄，飲酒常醉，不省其事。及義宣敗於梁山，暢為軍人所掠，衣服都盡。遇右將軍王玄謨乘輿出營，暢巳得敗衣，遂排玄謨上輿，玄謨甚不悅。諸將請殺之，隊主張世救之得免。執送都下，付廷尉，見原。","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-046-zhangchang-complete:p006:m0144"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"所見原官稱，未載全任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete:p025","text":"　　竟陵張欣時爲諸暨令，坐罪當死。欣時父興世宋世討南譙王義宣，官軍欲殺融父暢，興世以袍覆暢而坐之，以此得免。興世卒，融著高履負土成墳。至是融啓竟陵王子良，乞代欣時死。子良答曰：「此乃是長史美事，恐朝有常典，不得如長史所懷。」遷黃門郎，太子中庶子，司徒左長史。融有孝義，忌月三旬不聽樂，事嫂甚謹。宋丞相義宣起事，父暢以不同將見殺，司馬竺超民諫免之。暢臨終謂諸子曰：「昔丞相事難，吾緣竺司馬得活，爾等必報其子弟。」後超民孫微冬月遭母喪，居貧，融往弔之，悉脫衣以爲賻，披牛被而反。常以兄事微。豫章王嶷、竟陵王子良薨，自以身經佐吏，哭輙盡慟。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":60,"last_line":60,"raw_start":4819,"raw_end":5086,"raw_character_offsets":[4819,4820,4821,4822,4823,4824,4825,4826,4827,4828,4829,4830,4831,4832,4833,4834,4835,4836,4837,4838,4839,4840,4841,4842,4843,4844,4845,4846,4847,4848,4849,4850,4851,4852,4853,4854,4855,4856,4857,4858,4859,4860,4861,4862,4863,4864,4865,4866,4867,4868,4869,4870,4871,4872,4873,4874,4875,4876,4877,4878,4879,4880,4881,4882,4883,4884,4885,4886,4887,4888,4889,4890,4891,4892,4893,4894,4895,4896,4897,4898,4899,4900,4901,4902,4903,4904,4905,4906,4907,4908,4909,4910,4911,4912,4913,4914,4915,4916,4917,4918,4919,4920,4921,4922,4923,4924,4925,4926,4927,4928,4929,4930,4931,4932,4933,4934,4935,4936,4937,4938,4939,4940,4941,4942,4943,4944,4945,4946,4947,4948,4949,4950,4951,4952,4953,4954,4955,4956,4957,4958,4959,4960,4961,4962,4963,4964,4965,4966,4967,4968,4969,4970,4971,4972,4973,4974,4975,4976,4977,4978,4979,4980,4981,4982,4983,4984,4985,4986,4987,4988,4989,4990,4991,4992,4993,4994,4995,4996,4997,4998,4999,5000,5001,5002,5003,5004,5005,5006,5007,5008,5009,5010,5011,5012,5